Small patches to support my Dell Pro 14 Plus (PB14250)'s webcam.

This is done as a fork of the Linux kernel to make rebasing easy.

## Install

Clone the repo and run these commands:

```bash
ln drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu-bridge.c dellpro/dkms/ipu-bridge-patched-1.0/
sudo dkms add dellpro/dkms/ipu-bridge-patched-1.0

ln drivers/media/i2c/ov05c10.c dellpro/dkms/ov05c10-1.0/
sudo dkms add dellpro/dkms/ov05c10-1.0

sudo dkms autoinstall
```

## Uninstall

```bash
sudo dkms remove --all ipu-bridge-patched/1.0
sudo dkms remove --all ov05c10/1.0
```
